                                "example_id": "7ad81a2e-80a9-432f-bf41-0a9ca4766ee7",
                                "sense_id": "252d7795-806b-3c40-89c3-aee280dc18f3",
                                "text": "Caroline was that hard and unalterable fact which turned Martha's life, in spite of a pleasant and helpful nursegirl, into a routine which began at five sharp every morning when the light first showed, and ended at seven in the evening, when she went to bed."
